[FINAL ANSWER] The auto-scaling feature was 60% complete and became blocked because it fundamentally depended on the rolled-back advanced monitoring system's metrics, The project was split into two efforts: a basic rule-based auto-scaling using simple CPU/memory thresholds (which was implemented and completed) and a future advanced auto-scaling to be developed when proper monitoring infrastructure becomes available

